REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT6H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT6H
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nte-15-release@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261105T030000Z
DTEND:20261105T033000Z
SUMMARY:Neverness to Everness 1.5 Version Update
DESCRIPTION:A new S-rank character in the first half and an EX-tier in the 
 second half\, plus a new city logistics mode and tank battles. The version
  runs until Dec 17.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marked
  Estimated or TBC are projected from version cycles and may shift once off
 icially announced.
LOCATION:Neverness to Everness
CATEGORIES:Neverness to Everness
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
