DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261213T155900Z
DTEND:20261213T161400Z
SUMMARY:NTE 1.6 - Redemption codes expire (Computed)
DESCRIPTION:Valid 100 hours: stream starts Dec 09\, 19:30\, codes die Dec 1
 3\, 23:59 (UTC+8).\n\nThree codes worth 300 premium currency total.\nOnce 
 they expire they are gone - no reissues\, no appeals.\n\nRedeem in game un
 der Phone > the ... menu (top right) > Redemption Code.\nMissed the stream
 ? The VOD description and the official preview page usually list all three
  codes.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated o
 r TBC are projected from version cycles and may shift once officially anno
 unced.
LOCATION:Neverness to Everness - Redemption page
CATEGORIES:Neverness to Everness
